  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-10-13T21:32:30.184Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Well the new UI is needs to be improved, it's overly complicated and you can't just select the safety setting by just leaving the menu after selecting it, you need to confirm the change by pressing an extra button.\nFriend list is now separated by categories instead of just scrolling down to the groups and the buttons and writings are so small i personally need to squint my eyes or literally walk closer to the menu.\nI think the old UI for the world, friend and security tabs were perfect, but the one right now has too much info on screen and is hard to find what you need.\nThe UI updates needs to simplify, not complicate and just adding things and buttons at random, it needs to be well tough, which seems this hasn't been the case here.",
